{"id": "e51f4d1e-5554-4b72-9f09-e176f1f30413", "slug": "modular-architecture-1", "title": "Modular Architecture", "description": "Modular Architecture UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Modular Architecture\"\ndescription: \"Modular Architecture UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Modular Architecture\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 16; favorites: 9; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nModular Architecture UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nModular Core Architecture Streamline performance metrics by deploying only the essential operational nodes required for execution. Node Alpha: 0.64 MB Cache Proxy: 1.28 MB Render State: 0.12 MB System Allocation 32.45 M…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Modular Core Architecture; System Allocation.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #0A0A0A, accent #FFFFFF, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Modular Architecture</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        .reveal-overflow {\n            display: inline-block;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n        .reveal-word {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(110%);\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n\n        .gradient-border-container {\n            position: relative;\n            background: #0f0f0f;\n            border-radius: 0.75rem;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        .gradient-border-container::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -1px;\n            border-radius: 0.8rem;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\n            z-index: -1;\n            mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n            padding: 1px;\n        }\n\n        .halftone-bg {\n            background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n                45deg,\n                rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 25%,\n                transparent 25%,\n                transparent 75%,\n                rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 75%,\n                rgba(255,255,255,0.01)\n            ),\n            repeating-linear-gradient(\n                45deg,\n                rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 25%,\n                #0a0a0a 25%,\n                #0a0a0a 75%,\n                rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 75%,\n                rgba(255,255,255,0.01)\n            );\n            background-position: 0 0, 2px 2px;\n            background-size: 4px 4px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"font-['Inter'] antialiased text-neutral-300 bg-[#0a0a0a] overflow-hidden min-h-screen w-full relative selection:bg-neutral-800 selection:text-neutral-100\">\n\n    <!-- Half-tone Pattern Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none halftone-bg z-0 opacity-80\"></div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Canvas Container -->\n    <div id=\"canvas-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"></div>\n\n    <!-- SVG Connection Lines -->\n    <svg id=\"connection-lines\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-[5]\">\n        <path id=\"line-1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" />\n        <path id=\"line-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" />\n        <path id=\"line-3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" />\n    </svg>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Layer -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-screen pointer-events-none flex flex-col justify-between p-8 md:p-20\">\n\n        <!-- Top Area: Typography (Right Aligned) -->\n        <div class=\"w-full flex justify-end\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-md pointer-events-auto text-right\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-[1.1] tracking-tight font-medium text-neutral-100 mb-5 mask-target\">\n                    Modular Core<br>Architecture\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed ml-auto max-w-[18rem] mask-target-p\">\n                    Streamline performance metrics by deploying only the essential operational nodes required for execution.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Middle Area: Fixed Stats Labels (Left Aligned) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute left-8 md:left-20 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col gap-16 pointer-events-auto z-10\">\n            <div id=\"label-1\" class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 font-medium tracking-wide flex items-center gap-3 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000 bg-neutral-900/50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-100 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.5)]\"></span> Node Alpha: 0.64 MB\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"label-2\" class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 font-medium tracking-wide flex items-center gap-3 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000 bg-neutral-900/50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-400\"></span> Cache Proxy: 1.28 MB\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"label-3\" class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 font-medium tracking-wide flex items-center gap-3 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000 bg-neutral-900/50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span> Render State: 0.12 MB\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Area: Widget (Left Aligned) -->\n        <div class=\"w-full flex justify-start pointer-events-auto\">\n            <div class=\"w-full max-w-[24rem]\">\n                <div class=\"gradient-border-container p-6 shadow-2xl shadow-black/40\">\n\n                    <!-- Widget Header -->\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mb-4\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-neutral-100 text-sm font-medium tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            System Allocation\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:info-circle-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </h3>\n                        <span class=\"text-neutral-400 text-xs tracking-wide font-medium\">32.45 MB Total</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Progress Bar (Neutral palette) -->\n                    <div class=\"h-1.5 w-full rounded-full flex overflow-hidden mb-6 bg-neutral-800\">\n                        <div class=\"h-full bg-neutral-200 w-[15%]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"h-full bg-neutral-400 w-[25%]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"h-full bg-neutral-500 w-[10%]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"h-full bg-neutral-600 w-[20%]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"h-full bg-neutral-700 w-[5%]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"h-full bg-neutral-900 w-[25%] border-l border-white/5\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Legend Grid -->\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-y-3 gap-x-4 mb-6\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-200\"></span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">Renderer</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-400\"></span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">Physics</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-500\"></span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">Logic</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-600\"></span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">Audio</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-700\"></span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">Network</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border border-white/10 rounded-sm p-[1px]\">\n                            <span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-neutral-400 ml-[1px]\"></span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">Assets</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Bottom Timeline visual -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-8 bg-neutral-900/50 rounded-lg border border-white/5 flex items-center px-2 justify-between relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-around opacity-20\">\n                            <script>\n                                for(let i=0; i<40; i++) {\n                                    document.write(`<div class=\"w-px h-2 bg-neutral-400\"></div>`);\n                                }\n                            </script>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute h-full w-px bg-neutral-100 z-10 left-[75%] shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)] mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        function wrapWords(selector) {\n            const elements = document.querySelectorAll(selector);\n            elements.forEach(el => {\n                const text = el.innerHTML;\n                const words = text.split(/(<br>|\\s+)/);\n                el.innerHTML = '';\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    if (word === '<br>') {\n                        el.innerHTML += '<br>';\n                    } else if (word.trim() !== '') {\n                        el.innerHTML += `<span class=\"reveal-overflow\"><span class=\"reveal-word\">${word}</span></span> `;\n                    } else {\n                        el.innerHTML += word;\n                    }\n                });\n            });\n        }\n\n        wrapWords('.mask-target');\n\n        const pEl = document.querySelector('.mask-target-p');\n        if(pEl) {\n             const text = pEl.innerText;\n             pEl.innerHTML = `<span class=\"reveal-overflow block\"><span class=\"reveal-word block\" style=\"transform: translateY(120%);\">${text}</span></span>`;\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            gsap.to('.mask-target .reveal-word', {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.08,\n                ease: 'power4.out',\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            gsap.to('.mask-target-p .reveal-word', {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: 'power3.out',\n                delay: 0.6\n            });\n\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                document.querySelectorAll('[id^=\"label-\"]').forEach((el, index) => {\n                    setTimeout(() => el.classList.remove('opacity-0'), index * 200);\n                });\n            }, 1200);\n        });\n\n        const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n        scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x0a0a0a, 0.02);\n\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n        camera.position.set(15, 12, 35);\n        camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        const wireMaterial = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n            color: 0x666666,\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.8,\n            linewidth: 1\n        });\n\n        const group = new THREE.Group();\n        group.position.x = 5;\n        const parts = [];\n\n        function createWireframeObj(geometry, yOffset) {\n            const edges = new THREE.EdgesGeometry(geometry);\n            const line = new THREE.LineSegments(edges, wireMaterial);\n            line.position.y = yOffset;\n\n            line.userData = {\n                baseY: 0,\n                targetY: yOffset,\n                rotationSpeed: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.015\n            };\n\n            line.position.y = 0;\n\n            group.add(line);\n            parts.push(line);\n            return line;\n        }\n\n        const coreGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(5, 5, 6, 32, 4);\n        createWireframeObj(coreGeo, 0);\n\n        const gear1Geo = new THREE.TorusGeometry(3.5, 0.8, 16, 24);\n        gear1Geo.rotateX(Math.PI / 2);\n        createWireframeObj(gear1Geo, 1.5);\n\n        const gear2Geo = new THREE.TorusGeometry(2, 0.5, 16, 16);\n        gear2Geo.rotateX(Math.PI / 2);\n        createWireframeObj(gear2Geo, -1.5);\n\n        const topCapGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(4.5, 5, 2, 32);\n        createWireframeObj(topCapGeo, 6);\n\n        const topDetailGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(3, 3, 3, 16);\n        createWireframeObj(topDetailGeo, 8.5);\n\n        const botCapGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(5, 4.5, 2, 32);\n        createWireframeObj(botCapGeo, -5);\n\n        const botDetailGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(2, 3, 2, 8);\n        createWireframeObj(botDetailGeo, -7);\n\n        const sideGearGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(4, 4, 1, 24);\n        const sideGear = createWireframeObj(sideGearGeo, 0);\n        sideGear.userData.targetX = -10;\n        sideGear.userData.targetY = 4;\n        sideGear.userData.targetZ = 3;\n        sideGear.rotation.x = 0.5;\n\n        const sideDiscGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(6, 6, 0.2, 32);\n        const sideDisc = createWireframeObj(sideDiscGeo, 0);\n        sideDisc.userData.targetX = 12;\n        sideDisc.userData.targetY = -3;\n        sideDisc.userData.targetZ = -2;\n        sideDisc.rotation.x = -0.4;\n        sideDisc.rotation.z = 0.2;\n\n        scene.add(group);\n\n        const labels = [\n            { el: document.getElementById('label-1'), targetPart: parts[3], offset: new THREE.Vector3(0, 3, 0), pathId: 'line-1' },\n            { el: document.getElementById('label-2'), targetPart: sideGear, offset: new THREE.Vector3(0, 0, 0), pathId: 'line-2' },\n            { el: document.getElementById('label-3'), targetPart: sideDisc, offset: new THREE.Vector3(0, 0, 0), pathId: 'line-3' }\n        ];\n\n        let explodeProgress = 0;\n\n        gsap.to({ val: 0 }, {\n            val: 1,\n            duration: 3,\n            ease: \"power3.inOut\",\n            delay: 0.2,\n            onUpdate: function() {\n                explodeProgress = this.targets()[0].val;\n            }\n        });\n\n        let mouseX = 0;\n        let mouseY = 0;\n        let targetX = 0;\n        let targetY = 0;\n        const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n        const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n        document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n            mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX);\n            mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY);\n        });\n\n        function updateConnections() {\n            labels.forEach(item => {\n                if(!item.targetPart || !item.el) return;\n\n                const pos = new THREE.Vector3();\n                item.targetPart.getWorldPosition(pos);\n                pos.add(item.offset);\n                pos.project(camera);\n\n                const startX = (pos.x * .5 + .5) * window.innerWidth;\n                const startY = (pos.y * -.5 + .5) * window.innerHeight;\n\n                const rect = item.el.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const endX = rect.right + 16;\n                const endY = rect.top + rect.height / 2;\n\n                const path = document.getElementById(item.pathId);\n                if(path) {\n                    const ctrlX1 = startX - (startX - endX) * 0.4;\n                    const ctrlX2 = endX + (startX - endX) * 0.4;\n                    path.setAttribute('d', `M ${startX} ${startY} C ${ctrlX1} ${startY}, ${ctrlX2} ${endY}, ${endX} ${endY}`);\n                }\n            });\n        }\n\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n            targetX = mouseX * 0.0003;\n            targetY = mouseY * 0.0003;\n\n            group.rotation.y += 0.05 * (targetX - group.rotation.y);\n            group.rotation.x += 0.05 * (targetY - group.rotation.x);\n            group.rotation.y -= 0.0005;\n\n            parts.forEach(part => {\n                const currentY = THREE.MathUtils.lerp(0, part.userData.targetY || 0, explodeProgress);\n                part.position.y = currentY;\n\n                if (part.userData.targetX) part.position.x = THREE.MathUtils.lerp(0, part.userData.targetX, explodeProgress);\n                if (part.userData.targetZ) part.position.z = THREE.MathUtils.lerp(0, part.userData.targetZ, explodeProgress);\n\n                part.rotation.y += part.userData.rotationSpeed;\n            });\n\n            updateConnections();\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n\n        animate();\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "modular-architecture-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/modular-architecture-1.jpg", "source_name": "modular-architecture-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 71, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T22:49:35.887815+00:00"}